# The bundled interpreter is a third-party binary. It is attached to the
# GitHub Release as a ready-to-run zip, but it should not be tracked in git:
# it is 2.5 MB of someone else's code that changes on its own release cycle.
submacro/*.exe

# Per-user state. None of this belongs in a repository: it is what the app
# writes on this machine (last location, chosen options, session log).
settings/*.log
settings/*.ini

# Recorded routes are personal - they encode one player's run of one loop.
# The release ships no routes; each user records their own.
maps/*.route

# Python bytecode from the audit tooling
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Release output
dist/
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# inspiredby/ holds a COPY OF ANOTHER AUTHOR'S MACRO, placed here only as a
# reference to learn from. It carries their copyright notice ("please do not
# steal our code") and must never be committed or published. Reference material
# only; the code in this repo is independent.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
inspiredby/

# Generated test scaffolding and result dumps (the .py tests are kept - they are
# the actual suite; these are their throwaway outputs).
submacro/_*.ahk
submacro/_*_result.txt
tests/*_result.txt
